# Agent Notes

Follow [.agents/notes/README.md](../../.agents/notes/README.md).

Path: `{lifecycle}/{class}/yyyy-mm-dd-slug.md`. Status line must match the folder. New notes need Alternatives considered. Implemented notes use Decision and Consequences, never Proposal or Acceptance criteria. Archived notes are frozen.

Files with `Origin: Ai-notes/` are imported historical records. Do not copy that header onto new notes.
